        "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre:</strong> Adventure RPG with life simulator and visual novel elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong> Your journey will consist of exploring the world, interacting with numerous unique characters, making decisions, and solving a variety of puzzles. You will also engage in dynamic battles against dozens of enemy types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression:</strong> The game spans 11 years of the heroes' lives. Each year represents a new chapter with unique events, goals, and challenges. You will develop the characters' skills and strengthen their friendships, which unlocks new dialogues and opportunities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content:</strong> In addition to the main storyline, the world is filled with side quests (50 stories), hidden secrets, and additional activities that significantly increase the overall playtime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971600/extras/6fa7e0b96aadd057dee19b73f9337fa1.avif?t=1758011046\" width=96 height=76 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THE GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a grand 11-year saga of friendship, adventure, and growing up! This isn't just a game — it's an alternate life in a vast world full of mysteries, dangers, and fun. You'll experience a unique blend of genres: from a fun school life sim to epic battles in a legendary Colosseum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together with a team of six inseparable friends, you are about to live through the most vibrant part of life, where every day is a new discovery and every year brings new incredible adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971600/extras/e96b95d848d2df0e815312f3f1f83149.avif?t=1758011046\" width=96 height=76 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Vast World:</strong> Explore over 600 unique locations, from cozy school classrooms to mysterious ancient ruins and their inhabitants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World Full of Life:</strong> Constant hustle and bustle in the school hallways and epic snowball fights that spare no one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Trials:</strong> Battle 150+ types of enemies and defeat 11 legendary bosses in the Colosseum to prove your title of Invincible Gladiator.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Stories:</strong> Uncover 50 different stories and solve a sea of puzzles on your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Way Out:</strong> Make it to the very end and prove that you are ready to step into adult life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ultimate Challenge:</strong> Do you dare to face the FIRST GLADIATOR, the one who is absolutely INVINCIBLE? Can you find a way to defeat the undefeatable?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>P.S. If anyone can beat him, send me a video of the fight!</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre:</strong> Adventure RPG with life simulator and visual novel elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong> Your journey will consist of exploring the world, interacting with numerous unique characters, making decisions, and solving a variety of puzzles. You will also engage in dynamic battles against dozens of enemy types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression:</strong> The game spans 11 years of the heroes' lives. Each year represents a new chapter with unique events, goals, and challenges. You will develop the characters' skills and strengthen their friendships, which unlocks new dialogues and opportunities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content:</strong> In addition to the main storyline, the world is filled with side quests (50 stories), hidden secrets, and additional activities that significantly increase the overall playtime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971600/extras/6fa7e0b96aadd057dee19b73f9337fa1.avif?t=1758011046\" width=96 height=76 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THE GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a grand 11-year saga of friendship, adventure, and growing up! This isn't just a game — it's an alternate life in a vast world full of mysteries, dangers, and fun. You'll experience a unique blend of genres: from a fun school life sim to epic battles in a legendary Colosseum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together with a team of six inseparable friends, you are about to live through the most vibrant part of life, where every day is a new discovery and every year brings new incredible adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971600/extras/e96b95d848d2df0e815312f3f1f83149.avif?t=1758011046\" width=96 height=76 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Vast World:</strong> Explore over 600 unique locations, from cozy school classrooms to mysterious ancient ruins and their inhabitants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World Full of Life:</strong> Constant hustle and bustle in the school hallways and epic snowball fights that spare no one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Trials:</strong> Battle 150+ types of enemies and defeat 11 legendary bosses in the Colosseum to prove your title of Invincible Gladiator.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Stories:</strong> Uncover 50 different stories and solve a sea of puzzles on your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Way Out:</strong> Make it to the very end and prove that you are ready to step into adult life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ultimate Challenge:</strong> Do you dare to face the FIRST GLADIATOR, the one who is absolutely INVINCIBLE? Can you find a way to defeat the undefeatable?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>P.S. If anyone can beat him, send me a video of the fight!</strong></p>",
